---
import { SOURCE, DEFLATOR } from '../lib/items.ts';
---
<footer class="method measure">
  <p class="verdict">The things you can choose got cheaper. The things you can't opt out of rose fastest.</p>
  <p class="credit">Source: {SOURCE}</p>
  <p class="foot">
    Real price = each item's CPI (or average price) divided by all-items CPI-U, rebased to 100 at 1980
    (childcare at 1991, its first full year). Deflator: {DEFLATOR}.
  </p>
</footer>
